Depends on the role. A Wizard does not (usually) want to use a shield of
reflection, because it's bad for your casting rates; and anyway, he
starts with a CoMR, so he'll get a SDSM, and wear the Eye. A Samurai
doesn't want to use one either, because he wants to double-weapon; he'll
probably wear GDSM, a CoDisp or something like that, and an "oRefl. A
Ranger has no problems with the shield, so he'll wear GDSM, a SoRefl,
and some other kind of amulet; the Longbow does grant reflection as
well, but it's his own Quest Artifact, so it can be stolen.

